    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "IgG4-related sialadenitis",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "The vein in the right upper field shows fibrosis and transmural inflammatory cell infiltrate (obliterative phlebitis). The accompanying artery in the left lower field is uninvolved.",
